#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:5
#: 11d5b6208bde4dd792037bd66e5f649b
msgid "Nooploop TOFSense/-UART/S"
msgstr "Nooploop TOFSense/-UART/S"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:8
#: 55c00f27e3354ebeb715fa920aaa6bd6
msgid ""
"Support for this sensor is available in firmware versions 4.5 and later."
msgstr "固件 4.5 及更高版本支持此传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:10
#: bc307769ec794024a2c1a8abb437c626
msgid ""
"The `TOFSense/-UART/S "
"<https://ftp.nooploop.com/downloads/tofsense/TOFSense_Datasheet_V3.0_en.pdf>`__"
" is lightweight rangefinder module that provides fast and accurate distance "
"measurements up to 8 meters. It also has an adjustable field of view (FOV), "
"ranging from 15 to 27 degrees with a measurement resolution of 1mm. "
"ArduPilot currently supports this sensor via both UART and CAN."
msgstr ""
"`TOFSense/-UART/S "
"<https://ftp.nooploop.com/downloads/tofsense/TOFSense_Datasheet_V3.0_en.pdf>`__"
" 是一款轻量测距模块，可实现最远 8m 的快速精准测距。其视场角（FOV）可在 15 至 27 度范围内调整，测量分辨率为 1mm。ArduPilot "
"目前支持通过 UART 和 CAN 两种方式连接该传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:16
#: 7a14e4a4488a49e0aad9e5062ec70672
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:18
#: fd18d50b113d4b73952d1777465c5b57
msgid "This sensor my be connected either via UART or CAN."
msgstr "该传感器可通过 UART 或 CAN 连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:21
#: 0c7055fad4234c07958aa57056899072
msgid "Connecting via UART"
msgstr "通过 UART 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:23
#: 35a705f2c16042719b4aba7fbf7e5f96
msgid ""
"Setup the sensor through the NAssistant Software provided by the "
"manufacturer. More details can be found `here "
"<https://www.nooploop.com/download/>`__. For UART mode, in the setup screen "
"set \"Interface\" to UART, correct baudrate and Mode to \"active\". It is "
"recommended to reduce the baudrate from the default 921600, to a smaller "
"option (For example: 230400)"
msgstr ""
"通过制造商提供的 NAssistant 软件配置传感器，详情可在 `此处 <https://www.nooploop.com/download/>`__"
" 获取。对于 UART 模式，在设置界面将「Interface」设为 UART，配置正确的波特率并将模式设为「active」。建议将波特率从默认的 "
"921600 降低至较小值（例如 230400）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:29
#: 488a380043b7400da1133b634acfa187
msgid ""
"You can use any spare autopilot Serial/UART port. The diagram below shows "
"how to connect to SERIAL4 and the example parameters will be shown assuming "
"this Serial port is used."
msgstr "可使用任意空闲的飞控串口/UART 接口。下图展示了连接至 SERIAL4 的方式，示例参数也基于该串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:34
#: fc23d3d798f243619d2d90f2f8ed7bae
msgid "Set the following parameters:"
msgstr "设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:36
#: bf2a47b5587e415994db33380ca2e7f9
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:37
#: d051b20bfaac4f1cb126d54bdf843f1c
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD<SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 230400 (Or as set in NAssistant)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD<SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 230400（或与 NAssistant 中设置一致）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:38
#: 9553d05de768472dba7cb8079fb196dc
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 37 (NoopLoop_TOFSense) Reboot after "
"setting this."
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 37（NoopLoop_TOFSense），设置后重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:39
#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:68
#: 5183134914e24479ac3b8fc7382c9eed 8a4ffb5148af4a9c8dfd7d80b665a02c
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 8 (i.e. 8m max range)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 8（即最大量程 8m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:40
#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:69
#: 735b2313978d43689b873c9a075f936a bba39438664d45a09d3150d2d2dc95fc
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.02"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.02"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:44
#: 3e5692382eaf4e0298e76cc02cd8b978
msgid "Connecting via CAN"
msgstr "通过 CAN 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:46
#: 4c17d6add4c34f46a702c00e18e65f59
msgid ""
"Setup the sensor through the NAssistant Software provided by the "
"manufacturer. More details can be found `here "
"<https://www.nooploop.com/download/>`__. For CAN mode, in the setup screen "
"set \"Interface\" to CAN, Mode to \"active\", and bitrate to \"1000000\". "
"You can also set the \"ID\" to a unique number if planning to use multiple "
"TOFSenseP on a single CAN bus. Setting ID to 0 will accept all ID's."
msgstr ""
"通过制造商提供的 NAssistant 软件配置传感器，详情可在 `此处 <https://www.nooploop.com/download/>`__"
" 获取。对于 CAN 模式，在设置界面将「Interface」设为 CAN，模式设为「active」，波特率设为「1000000」。若计划在同一 CAN"
" 总线上使用多个 TOFSenseP，可将「ID」设置为唯一编号。将 ID 设为 0 将接受所有 ID 的数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:52
#: 31f1b5fe9bc14e498ee5247ff6929e49
msgid ""
"ArduPilot does not currently support  multiple instances of these "
"rangefinders connected to different CAN ports. If you would like to use "
"multiple instances of these CAN rangefinders together, connect them to the "
"same bus."
msgstr "ArduPilot 目前不支持将多个此类测距仪连接至不同 CAN 接口。若需同时使用多个此类 CAN 测距仪，请将它们连接至同一总线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:55
#: a42ed77aff4a4b2995419d50d309f424
msgid ""
"The 4 Pin JST-GH connector wiring of the sensor does not match with the CAN "
"wiring of most autopilots. Wiring incorrectly can lead to damaged sensor "
"and/or autopilot."
msgstr "传感器的 4 针 JST-GH 连接器接线与大多数飞控的 CAN 接线不匹配。接线错误可能导致传感器和/或飞控损坏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:57
#: 324f308612d64511ba792c63d4ab5b84
msgid ""
"For a CAN connection you can use any spare CAN port. Since this is not a "
"DroneCAN based sensor, you will not be able to use the connected port with "
"any other type of sensor. The diagram below shows how to connect to CAN2."
msgstr ""
"CAN 连接可使用任意空闲 CAN 接口。由于该传感器不基于 DroneCAN，所连接的接口将无法与其他类型传感器共用。下图展示了连接至 CAN2 "
"的方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:62
#: 025cb75113f549f7bf023a08f8012edf
msgid "Set the following parameters"
msgstr "设置以下参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:64
#: 20ddd2a3b9c14a19877b1ac07a418aec
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_P2_DRIVER <CAN_P2_DRIVER>` = 1 (to enable the CAN port and use "
"driver 2)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P2_DRIVER <CAN_P2_DRIVER>` = 1（启用 CAN 接口并使用驱动器 2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:65
#: 8b0b0312d0274471a44694d76aecca84
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_P2_BITRATE<CAN_P2_BITRATE>` = 1000000 (Or as set in NAssistant)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P2_BITRATE<CAN_P2_BITRATE>` = 1000000（或与 NAssistant 中设置一致）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:66
#: c7d83281a0aa493094611c96741b943f
msgid ":ref:`CAN_D2_PROTOCOL<CAN_D2_PROTOCOL>` = 13 (TOFSenseP protocol)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D2_PROTOCOL<CAN_D2_PROTOCOL>` = 13（TOFSenseP 协议）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:67
#: 3ab8c7394d054adabc6181ea2d9d42b9
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 38 (NoopLoop_TOFSense_CAN) Reboot after"
" setting this."
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 38（NoopLoop_TOFSense_CAN），设置后重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:70
#: 2578eb564ad24bf5b3f3dd0ec8d5ecee
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_RECV_ID <RNGFND1_RECV_ID>` = ID of the sensor (0 to accept "
"data from all CAN sensor IDs)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_RECV_ID <RNGFND1_RECV_ID>` = 传感器 ID（设为 0 可接受所有 CAN 传感器 ID 的数据）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:74
#: c58e6b128ba34982802e395d3147282b
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nooploop-tofsense-p.rst:76
#: d7eda7e7d55247d1b0c7228845d81ced
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离值可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据页面的「状态」选项卡中查看，请留意「rangefinder1」项。"
